  <item>
    <title>23. 一夫多妻的宗教自由：摩门教演变史</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6af23a40b4a4e20202f75b5e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6af23a40b4a4e20202f75b5e</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 21:53:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p></p><p><span>📖 时间轴|目录</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">02:03</a> 约瑟斯密的童年与“</span><strong><span>第一次异象</span></strong><span>”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="406">06:46</a> </span><strong><span>先知石</span></strong><span>（seer stone）</span><strong><span>与天使Moroni</span></strong><span>的降临</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="731">12:11</a> </span><strong><span>《摩门经》</span></strong><span>都讲了些什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="948">15:48</a> </span><strong><span>1831-1838</span></strong><span>--早期的制度建设&amp;密苏里的“</span><strong><span>摩门教徒灭绝令</span></strong><span>”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1672">27:52</a> 伊利诺伊圣城</span><strong><span>Nauvoo</span></strong><span> &amp; </span><strong><span>一夫多妻制</span></strong><span>的开端</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1932">32:12</a> 《纳府真相报》与约瑟斯密之死</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2262">37:42</a> </span><strong><span>杨百翰</span></strong><span>的崛起与</span><strong><span>犹他领地</span></strong><span>的建立</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> </span><strong><span>犹他战争</span></strong><span>与</span><strong><span>山地草场屠杀事件</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3313">55:13</a> </span><strong><span>反重婚法案</span></strong><span>与一夫多妻制的废止（</span><strong><span>1890 Manifesto</span></strong><span>）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3610">1:00:10</a> 犹他建州、老罗姆尼与摩门教的</span><strong><span>墨西哥支派</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3883">1:04:43</a> </span><strong><span>Short Creek Comunnity</span></strong><span>的原教旨摩门教徒</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiaEoKuYnxQL4X8o8twLE-5dXPF-.jpg"><p><span>约瑟斯密用来找到《摩门经》的先知石（教会官方照片）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsP5d_4mpLP4KQjVUaDlyg2nttDK.jpg"><p><span>Moroni指示斯密找到经板（盐湖城总部雕像）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlrIXGM0YV20aVpiA11kdeE5VfIm.jpg"><p><span>摩门总墓地中约瑟斯密的哥哥Hyrum Smith的墓碑</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FplGf2pejTn7wmlpNDi1KKcMP_HE.jpg"><p><span>盐湖城摩门教圣殿</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsSvVm_3TR71alDHcqGdNAVyEtPy.jpg"><p><span>大提顿山脚下的百年前摩门村庄遗迹</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong><span>参考书目</span></strong><span>：</span></p><p><span>John L. Brooke, “The Refiner's Fire: The Making of Mormon Cosmology, 1644–1844, Cambridge University Press, 1994; paperback 1996, ISBN-10: 0521565642.</span></p><p><span>Benjamin E. Park, “American Zion, A New History of Mormonism”, Liveright / W. W. Norton, Jan. 2024. ISBN-10: 1324096683</span></p><p><span>Arrington, Leonard J. (1958). Great Basin Kingdom: An Economic History of the Latter-day Saints, 1830–1900. Cambridge: Harvard University Press. Reprinted by University of Illinois Press, October 2004. ISBN&nbsp;0-252-02972-0.</span></p><p><span>杨煜达、满志敏、郑景云，“嘉庆云南大饥荒（1815-1817）与坦博拉火山喷发”，2005年第一期。 [中图分类号]　K903 　[文献标识码 ]　A　[文章编号]　0257 0289(2005)01 079 008</span></p><p><span>LeSueur, Stephen C. (1990).&nbsp;</span><em><span>The 1838 Mormon War in Missouri</span></em><span>.&nbsp;</span><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/University_of_Missouri_Press" data-url="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/University_of_Missouri_Press"><u><span>University of Missouri Press</span></u></a><span>.</span></p><p></p><p><span>欢迎添加 </span><strong><span>housreadingclub</span></strong><span> 加入听友群，分享你感兴趣的话题！</span></p><p></p><p><span>🎵</span><strong><span>音乐: </span></strong><span>Traditional Korean Festival Music</span></p><p><strong><span>视频/互动平台</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>哔哩哔哩</span></strong><span>：侯雪千Phoenix</span></p><p><strong><span>微博</span></strong><span>@侯雪千Phoenix</span></p><p><strong><span>YouTube</span></strong><span>：Phoenix Hou</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6694ae3d5b1d989071f22c2b/lnnfwxkQ_UBM9R4C3hVsUmkdXrAG.m4a" length="68718449" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:10:45</itunes:duration>
