  <item>
    <title>22. 王莽赶刘秀：一个荒诞传说如何衍生出上千个地名？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a54a9dfca0de6c44ae659f1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a54a9dfca0de6c44ae659f1</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 13 Jul 2026 09:14:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p></p><p><span>📖 时间轴|目录</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="69">01:09</a> 王莽为什么不可能追过刘秀？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="278">04:38</a> 《后汉书》中的刘秀河北逃亡</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="468">07:48</a> 安平圣姑庙没有山门的传说</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="849">14:09</a> 刘秀在河北饶阳：天下讵可知，而闭长者乎？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1042">17:22</a> 深州市“风飘凌霄水大流”的传说</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1175">19:35</a> 到底是谁扳倒井：刘秀、戚继光、还是赵匡胤？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1391">23:11</a> 赞皇县五马山上的五匹石马</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1552">25:52</a> 冯异与滹沱麦饭、芜蒌豆粥的故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a> 苏东坡《豆粥》</span></p><p></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm-Z2duZY3m9xo0y_Oati2X3ick1.jpg"><p><span>安平圣姑庙</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr6CdrFRb3lpcqhwF1-V_3ZMpWGY.jpg"><p><span>深州市汉皇路上的大流村</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmaC0aHJrJM9o4VEYskkhWi5ju36.jpg"><p><span>赞皇五马山石马</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsXy4MuP8hzL_MRoW-IXo2mwYyE7.jpg"><p><span>日军侵华前的深县芜蒌亭</span></p><p></p><p><span>蘇軾《豆粥》</span></p><p><span>君不見滹沱流澌車折軸，公孫倉皇奉豆粥。</span><br><span>濕薪破竈自燎衣，飢寒頓解劉文叔。</span><br><span>又不見金谷敲冰草木春，帳下烹煎皆美人。</span><br><span>萍虀豆粥不傳法，咄嗟而辦石季倫。</span><br><span>干戈未解身如寄，聲色相纏心已醉。</span><br><span>身心顛倒自不知，更識人間有真味。</span><br><span>豈如江頭千頃雪色蘆，茒檐出沒晨煙孤。</span><br><span>地碓舂秔光似玉，沙瓶煮豆軟如酥。</span><br><span>我老此身無著處，賣書來問東家住。</span><br><span>臥聽雞鳴粥熟時，蓬頭曵履君家去。</span></p><p><span>欢迎添加 housreadingclub 加入听友群，分享你感兴趣的话题！</span></p><p></p><p><span>音乐</span></p><p><span>Traditional Korean Festival Music</span></p><p></p><p><span>视频/互动平台</span></p><p><span>哔哩哔哩：侯雪千Phoenix</span></p><p><span>微博@侯雪千Phoenix</span></p><p><span>YouTube：Phoenix Hou</span></p>]]></description>
