    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Feb 2026 09:50:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>📖 时间轴|目录</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">02:46</a> 英国北美殖民地的建立与自治传统</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="423">07:03</a> 1787宪法 &amp;《联邦党人文集》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="583">09:43</a> 联邦党与民主共和党的形成与矛盾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1109">18:29</a> 法属美洲 &amp; 路易斯安那购买案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1339">22:19</a> 美国独立后的英美矛盾：seizures &amp; impressment</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1718">28:38</a> 麦迪逊上台与1812战争的开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2012">33:32</a> 英国大反攻：华盛顿大火、麦克亨利堡之战与国歌的诞生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2434">40:34</a>《根特协定》签订之后的新奥尔良大捷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2657">44:17</a> 1812战争的历史影响</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpwUIi1J-YkpXZPi2EwOoRVjqX8l.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>美国建国时的13州</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhghZFfcWuEn1XMQJEGeirb600uF.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>路易斯安那购买案的领土扩张</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmhxDfnOmb061xWsYxf6Dl7luHAh.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>大火后的白宫</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhZKhniXHnREImcNdJgOTL7xEJA7.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>巴尔的摩Fort McHenry 麦克亨利堡</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>TraditionalKorean Festival Music</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>视频/互动平台</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>哔哩哔哩：侯雪千Phoenix</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博@侯雪千Phoenix</span></p><span></span><p><span>YouTube：PhoenixHou</span></p>]]></description>
