  <item>
    <title>19. 从釜山到扬州：寻访唐代新罗留学生崔致远</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/697329ac109824f9e1205458</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">697329ac109824f9e1205458</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 23 Jan 2026 08:14:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一个外国人如何以一篇《檄黄巢书》闻名大唐朝野？今天我们聊聊新罗第一才子、东海文章之祖崔致远的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>📖 时间轴|目录</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="182">03:02</a> 崔致远的出身：</span><strong><span>三韩</span></strong><span>与新罗的</span><strong><span>骨品制度</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="557">09:17</a> 唐代为外国人设立的</span><strong><span>宾贡科</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="614">10:14</a>崔致远的</span><strong><span>长安</span></strong><span>留学生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="892">14:52</a>关于唐代的慈恩寺</span><strong><span>雁塔提名</span></strong><span>传统</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1082">18:02</a>崔致远浪跡</span><strong><span>东都洛阳</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1163">19:23</a>补</span><strong><span>溧水县尉</span></strong><span>与</span><strong><span>双女坟</span></strong><span>的香艳传说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1554">25:54</a>入</span><strong><span>淮南节度使高骈</span></strong><span>幕府</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1936">32:16</a>惊艳朝野的讨贼檄文</span><strong><span>《檄黄巢书》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2431">40:31</a>回归新罗：</span><strong><span>伽倻山海印寺</span></strong><span>仙解与</span><strong><span>海云台</span></strong><span>的传说</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fky3A0ftml_Og3gEDj3VZWnW-cgz.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>扬州唐城遗址---淮南节度使府衙</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmjpmkKIZ6DTNTcpWoQGMAlk6xrK.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>崔致远纪念馆内崔致远雕像</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuZhgwoXkyOOr_q6YS2ILFXlnS8D.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>中韩友谊林内全斗焕手植之木</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnYDR4qyXMMVdlZw2I2bw2SWij_0.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>海印寺内的崔致远像</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FotcKPacjb1_K-wtFKOECEfiDoym.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>釜山海云台东柏公园崔致远像</span></p><span></span><p><span>长安旅舍，与于慎微长官接邻</span></p><span></span><p><span>上国羇栖久，多惭万里人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>那堪颜氏巷？得接孟家邻。</span></p><span></span><p><span>守道惟稽古，交情岂惮贫？</span></p><span></span><p><span>他乡少知己，莫厌访君频。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>安南</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>西戎始定南蠻起。都護能摧驃信威。</span></p><span></span><p><span>萬里封疆萬戶口。一麾風雨盡收歸。</span></p><span></span><p><span>射雕</span></p><span></span><p><span>能將一箭落雙鵰。萬里胡塵當日銷。</span></p><span></span><p><span>永使威名振沙漠。犬戎無復吠唐堯。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>西川</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>遠持龍旆活龜城。威懾蒙王永罷兵。</span></p><span></span><p><span>應笑欒巴噀杯酒。雨師風伯自歸行。</span></p><span></span><p><span>遊慶南伽耶山海印寺二首之二</span></p><span></span><p><span>伽耶山路客紛紛，毗盧佛前道故人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>得窺藏經八萬卷，始知東海三味真。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎添加housreadingclub加入听友群，分享你感兴趣的话题！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Bibliography</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>崔致遠《桂苑筆耕集》</span></p><span></span><p><span>道州 金在華《慶州崔氏譜序》</span></p><span></span><p><span>岑仲勉《隋唐史》</span></p><span></span><p><span>濱田耕策 “『東文選』と崔致遠の遺文” 九州大学大学院人文科学研究院歴史学部門</span></p><span></span><p><span>党银平 “唐代宾贡进士特殊管理体制新探” 南京大学中文系博士后科程</span></p><span></span><p><span>蔡振念 &nbsp;“来唐新罗诗人崔致远生平著作交游考” 台湾国立中山大学中国文学系《文与哲》第二十三期</span></p><span></span><p><span>李裕民 &nbsp;“雁塔提名研究”《长安大学学报（社会科学版）》第12卷 第2期</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>TraditionalKorean Festival Music</span></p><span></span><p><span>视频/互动平台</span></p><span></span><p><span>哔哩哔哩：侯雪千Phoenix</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博@侯雪千Phoenix</span></p><span></span><p><span>YouTube：PhoenixHou</span></p>]]></description>
