    <pubDate>Fri, 15 Aug 2025 15:21:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>📖 时间轴|目录</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="19">00:19</a> 复习上一期：《诗经》的体例及年代</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="58">00:58</a> “飨礼”与“燕礼”中赋哪些诗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="139">02:19</a> &nbsp;周代社会面貌的演变：犬戎之乱、平王东迁、射王中肩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="224">03:44</a> 赋诗如何“断章取义”？叔孙杀公若：臣之业在《扬水》卒章之四</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="356">05:56</a>飨礼赋诗的稳定性：叔孙穆叔如晋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="604">10:04</a>燕礼赋诗：赋诗言志 &amp; 断章取义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">12:40</a> 赋诗言志的典型例子：弭兵之盟 &amp; 垂陇之会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="877">14:37</a> 鲁之“三桓”与郑之“七穆”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1013">16:53</a> 子展赋《国风-召南-草虫》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1163">19:23</a> 良宵赋《国风-鄘風-鶉之賁賁》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1315">21:55</a> 断章取义的外交价值</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎加入追来园杂记听友群！</span></p><span></span><p><span>二维码过期时请添加 housreadingclub 加入听友群，分享你感兴趣的话题！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrsDzBPzc4whNWPdYQVuYXnkWNBo.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>🎵音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>TraditionalKorean Festival Music</span></p><span></span><p><span>视频/互动平台</span></p><span></span><p><span>哔哩哔哩：侯雪千Phoenix</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博@侯雪千Phoenix</span></p>]]></description>
