    <title>16. 郑风淫？| 古人如何用《诗经》外交？（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6895a1f0638b015879974277</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6895a1f0638b015879974277</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 08 Aug 2025 07:07:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天来聊聊《诗经》最开始的面貌！</span></p><span></span><p><span>📖 时间轴|目录</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="79">01:19</a> 高本汉《汉语的本质和历史》里的《诗经》问题：《小雅 天保》“何福不除”的“除”到底啥意思？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="191">03:11</a>上古汉语拟音：李方桂体系、白-沙体系、郑张-潘体系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a> 先秦时候“赋诗”与后世的“赋诗”之区别 &amp;“赋诗断章”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="373">06:13</a> 《诗经》六义：风雅颂、赋比兴。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="405">06:45</a> 如何理解“国风”？（《邶风》《鄘风》《卫风》都是卫国的诗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="513">08:33</a>《大雅》《小雅》的级别差距。《雅》的名称由来、子曰“詩書執禮，皆雅言也”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="667">11:07</a>《周颂》的年代最早，多在周穆王之前</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="696">11:36</a> 《商颂》的年代：商诗论 vs 宋诗论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="821">13:41</a> 诗经最早的一篇《豳风-鸱鸮》：周公旦平三监之乱的记录</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="975">16:15</a> 诗经最晚的一篇《陈风-株林》：百姓讽刺陈灵公与夏姬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1154">19:14</a> 申包胥哭秦庭，秦君为之赋《无衣》，借五百乘兵伐吴复楚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1268">21:08</a> 先秦的外交礼节第一步：飨礼。“烹太牢以飲賓，獻依命數，在廟行之”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1412">23:32</a> 飨礼中的赋诗步骤：以大雅《文王》三篇为例</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1604">26:44</a> 周人与酒的关系：太公作《酒诰》与“禁”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1681">28:01</a> 燕礼中的《诗》就轻松许多，如《关鸠》《采苹》《采蘩》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1828">30:28</a> 周代后期的社会巨变与赋诗面貌的变化</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnS4KVsisyS6juey7iWO1BI9NYHW.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>“向”字的初文</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqYWOOhxYYGEg3-jXvhkdW-vFBfp.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>雲紋銅禁（河南淅川县出土，河南博物院馆藏）</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎加入追来园杂记听友群！</span></p><span></span><p><span>二维码过期时请添加 housreadingclub 加入听友群，分享你感兴趣的话题！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiW6JbWVFQaLlmzj3beoHcCxlCG8.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>🎵音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>TraditionalKorean Festival Music</span></p><span></span><p><span>视频/互动平台</span></p><span></span><p><span>哔哩哔哩：侯雪千Phoenix</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博@侯雪千Phoenix</span></p><span></span><p><span>YouTube：PhoenixHou</span></p>]]></description>
