    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>📖 时间轴|目录</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="148">02:28</a> 烧酒与白酒同源：蒙古帝国与阿拉伯人的arak</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="484">08:04</a> 关于烧酒起源于汉、唐、宋之理论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="775">12:55</a> 日治时期：新式烧酒的引入&amp;廉价的台湾麻薯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1166">19:26</a> 朝鲜战争与现代韩国烧酒的流变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1406">23:26</a> 辣牛肉汤其实是“肉狗酱”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1763">29:23</a> 狗肉作为“嫌恶食品”的淡出与韩国民主化转型</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2018">33:38</a> 大邱特产：辣牛肉汤的产生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2155">35:55</a> 韩国各地的特色汤饭</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrGEuFtR0Uwvd6X6c_EZ4ozymMjU.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>元代蒙古蒸馏法vs汉人蒸馏法</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhPmFiSLl4rp_gNAbnXIip_VnddL.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>真露烧酒的度数变化</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpX1wQUcoja54yHuVEHaaJDvwhs6.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>辣牛肉汤</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhy7lO07JS2h6FJI8z-De7pVGO8Z.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>补身汤</span></p><span></span><p><span>索引</span></p><span></span><p><span>“식탁 위의 한국사”(《饭桌上的韩国史》) by 주영하 (Ju Yongha)</span></p><span></span><p><span>“Soju: a Global History” by Hyunhee Park</span></p><span></span><p><span>王赛时《中国酒史》</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎加入追来园杂记听友群！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FopSvYQyfHZ62jGWxybdSj8RUAab.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>二维码过期时请添加 housreadingclub 加入听友群，分享你感兴趣的话题！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>TraditionalKorean Festival Music</span></p><span></span><p><span>📺视频/互动