  <item>
    <title>13. 古尔邦节特辑：维吾尔谚语里的馕、烤肉与酸奶</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6842db7779e285b9b89570fe</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6842db7779e285b9b89570fe</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 06 Jun 2025 12:21:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>又到了古尔邦节，今天就来聊一聊最近学维语的过程中碰到的一些维吾尔俗语\谚语以及里面涉及的美食！</span></p><span></span><p><span>📖 时间轴|目录</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 散兰大但是没信仰，桌布大但是没有馕！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="223">03:43</a> 赚两个馕就拿一个当鼓打？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="307">05:07</a>“窝窝馕”与“小圆馕”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="608">10:08</a>维吾尔俗语中个“马槽”（oqur）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1029">17:09</a>维吾尔俗语中个“烤肉”（kawap）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1504">25:04</a>维吾尔俗语中个“酸奶”（qi:tiq）和“刨冰”（doghap）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">23:30</a>今天的羊肺也胜过明天的羊尾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1579">26:19</a>小猫吃不着肉就说自己封了斋。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqiC9g7qqF8MTgrAK0R2KucS4Mdu.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>窝窝馕 girde</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiAG1PzuTzVfrQHK3mu3yugEQBk_.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>小圆馕 toqach</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu5th0qt20FurKOH1-BazWZPdyW9.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>维吾尔馕坑</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoPsIvUFuiOLUWuiA3ciiVt1zbxD.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>面肺子米肠子</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>开头：Traditional KoreanFestival Music</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾：Kongulgha Nasihat----Sanubar Tursun</span></p><span></span><p><span>视频/互动平台</span></p><span></span><p><span>哔哩哔哩：侯雪千Phoenix</span></p>]]></description>
