  <item>
    <title>11. 聊聊语言学习的魅力：声音的拼图&amp;词汇的血脉传承</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680b59bf8aed253fa37b502b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">680b59bf8aed253fa37b502b</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 25 Apr 2025 09:50:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天简单聊一聊语言学习的魅力到底在哪里！</span></p><span></span><p><span>📖 时间轴|目录</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="177">02:57</a> 如果语法是钢金骨架，词汇就是门窗砖瓦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="453">07:33</a> 词汇的血脉传承：英语的</span><strong><span>God</span></strong><span> &amp; 波斯人的</span><strong><span>Xuda</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="623">10:23</a> </span><strong><span>明仁天皇</span></strong><span>的“平成”vs </span><strong><span>鲁文公</span></strong><span>的“平成”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="754">12:34</a> 学“死”了的语言还是“活”的语言：</span><strong><span>书面阅读 vs 口语交流</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="938">15:38</a> 听力训练的快感：以声音为基础的拼图游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1203">20:03</a> </span><strong><span>语言学习</span></strong><span>和</span><strong><span>商业旅行</span></strong><span>都是现代人的特权</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵 音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>TraditionalKorean Festival Music</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📺 视频/互动平台</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>哔哩哔哩：侯雪千Phoenix</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博@侯雪千Phoenix</span></p><span></span><p><span>YouTube：PhoenixHou</span></p>]]></description>
